          {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Continue the first +10 increments across all six positions, replacing the explicit repeated cycle by 10n.", "misconception": "Infer an arithmetic progression from the first three terms and overwrite the later given values."}
        ]
