          {"id": "B", "text": "| 两端点 | 中间项 $b_j$ 的下标 |\n| --- | --- |\n| $b_{20},b_{25}$ | $21\\le j\\le24$ |\n| $b_k,b_{k+7}$ | $k+1\\le j\\le k+6$ |\n| $b_{k-2},b_{k+3}$ | $k-1\\le j\\le k+2$ |", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "C", "text": "| 两端点 | 中间项 $b_j$ 的下标 |\n| --- | --- |\n| $b_{20},b_{25}$ | $21\\le j\\le25$ |\n| $b_k,b_{k+7}$ | $k+1\\le j\\le k+7$ |\n| $b_{k-2},b_{k+3}$ | $k-1\\le j\\le k+3$ |", "figure_ids": []}
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "Identify every interior position in three numerical/symbolic intervals and exclude both endpoints.",
        "source_solution": "Interior lists: b21,b22,b23,b24; b(k+1)..b(k+6); b(k-1),b_k,b(k+1),b(k+2). In general L<j<U is equivalent to L+1<=j<=U-1 for integer j.",
        "unit_reason": "One coherent interval table represents the same endpoint-exclusion rule across all three cases, retaining full lists via exact integer ranges.",
        "concept_blocks": [7,8,9],
